window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She left Earth to escape her broken marriage. She didn't expect to fall for a gray alien with a tail—or to face an impossible choice between her past and her future.</b></p> <p>Melinda Garcia is starting over. As Earth Federation's newly appointed ambassador to Krovatia, she's finally putting her career first—and leaving behind the man she still loves.</p> <p>Wyatt has spent twenty years loving only one woman. But his fear of space travel cost him his marriage. Now Melinda is on another planet, and he'll do anything to win her back.</p> <p>Kirimor is Krovatia's most powerful priest, bound by ancient traditions and complicated obligations. But the moment he meets the Earth ambassador, everything changes. He wants Melinda—and he's willing to risk it all to claim her.</p> <p><b>Two men. One woman caught between second chances and new beginnings.</b> In this scorching love triangle, Melinda must choose: the familiar love she left behind, or the alien who promises her everything—including the wickedly skilled tail that leaves her breathless.</p> <p><i>\"This has become one of my favorite all-time sci-fi novels.\"</i> —Goodreads</p> <p><b>A standalone high-heat sci-fi alien romance featuring a mature heroine, love triangle, gray alien with a tail, and a guaranteed HEA.</b></p> <p><i>This audiobook also includes a bonus 2-hour long sequel story called </i><b><i>Wyatt's Redemption</i></b><i>.</i></p>"; 
